#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Workarounds"
msgstr "兼容性变通"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "Some hacks that might be required to make things work."
msgstr "为使功能正常工作可能需要的一些变通措施。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Application ID mode"
msgstr "应用 ID 模式"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Specifies the application ID mode."
msgstr "指定应用 ID 模式。"

#. (itstool) path: desc/_name
msgid "Stock"
msgstr "标准"

#. (itstool) path: desc/_name
msgid "GTK Shell"
msgstr "GTK Shell"

#. (itstool) path: desc/_name
msgid "Full"
msgstr "完整"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Make all dialogs modal"
msgstr "将所有对话框设为模态"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"If false, the main window can be focused even if it has a dialog. The dialog "
"is nevertheless kept on top of the main window. Kwin defaults to false."
msgstr "若为 false，即使主窗口带有对话框，主窗口仍可获得焦点。但对话框仍保持在主窗口上方。KWin 默认为 false。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Allow dynamic repaint delay"
msgstr "允许动态重绘延迟"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"If true, allows Wayfire to dynamically recalculate its max_render_time, i.e "
"allow render time higher than max_render_time."
msgstr "若为 true，允许 Wayfire 动态重新计算 max_render_time，即允许渲染时间高于 max_render_time。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Use external output configuration instead of Wayfire's own."
msgstr "使用外部输出配置代替 Wayfire 自身的配置。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"If true, Wayfire will not handle any configuration options for outputs in "
"the config file once an external daemon like https://github.com/emersion/"
"kanshi sets the output configuration via the wlr-output-management protocol. "
"Exceptions are made for options not available via wlr-output-management, "
"like output mirroring and custom modelines."
msgstr ""
"若为 true，当外部守护进程（例如 https://github.com/emersion/kanshi）通过 "
"wlr-output-management 协议设置输出配置后，Wayfire 将不再处理配置文件中任何输出相关选项。对于 "
"wlr-output-management 无法提供的选项（例如输出镜像和自定义模型行）则例外。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Allow views to overlap between multiple outputs."
msgstr "允许窗口在多个输出之间重叠。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Allow views to overlap between multiple outputs. Many of the core plugins "
"will not behave properly with this option set!"
msgstr "允许窗口在多个输出之间重叠。启用此选项后，许多核心插件将无法正常工作！"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid ""
"Force xdg-decoration clients to use the compositor-preferred decoration mode."
msgstr "强制 xdg-decoration 客户端使用合成器首选的装饰模式。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Force xdg-decoration clients to use the compositor-preferred decoration mode "
"regardless of the client's preference."
msgstr "无论客户端偏好如何，强制 xdg-decoration 客户端使用合成器首选的装饰模式。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Enable calling dlclose() when a plugin is unloaded"
msgstr "插件卸载时调用 dlclose()"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enable calling dlclose() when a plugin is unloaded. Note that this may not "
"work well with all plugins."
msgstr "插件卸载时调用 dlclose()。注意，这可能并非对所有插件都有效。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Discard output from commands invoked by Wayfire."
msgstr "丢弃 Wayfire 调用命令的输出。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Discard output from commands invoked by Wayfire, so that they don't end up "
"in the logs."
msgstr "丢弃 Wayfire 调用命令的输出，以免其出现在日志中。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Enable support for the newer input-method-v2 protocol."
msgstr "启用对较新的 input-method-v2 协议的支持。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enable support for the newer input-method-v2 protocol. Note that the input-"
"method-v1 protocol works better in many cases."
msgstr "启用对较新的 input-method-v2 协议的支持。注意，在许多情况下 input-method-v1 协议工作得更好。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid ""
"Enable certain damage optimizations which are based on a surfaces' opaque "
"regions."
msgstr "启用基于表面不透明区域的某些重绘优化。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enable certain damage optimizations which are based on a surfaces' opaque "
"regions. In some cases, this optimization might give unexpected results (i.e "
"background app stops updating) even though this is fine according to "
"Wayland's protocol."
msgstr "启用基于表面不透明区域的某些重绘优化。在某些情况下，尽管符合 Wayland 协议，此优化仍可能导致意外结果（例如后台应用停止更新）。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Force frame synchronization."
msgstr "强制帧同步。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"This option can be used to workaround driver bugs that cause rendering "
"artifacts, though can cause more resource usage. Leave disabled if unsure."
msgstr "此选项可用于绕过导致渲染伪影的驱动缺陷，但可能增加资源占用。不确定时请保持禁用。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Maximum buffer size"
msgstr "最大缓冲区大小"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Maximum size in pixels of graphics buffers used for rendering. Needs to be "
"set lower on some systems to avoid crashes and other issues."
msgstr "用于渲染的图形缓冲区最大尺寸（像素）。在某些系统上需要设置得更低，以避免崩溃和其他问题。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Disable primary selection"
msgstr "禁用主选区"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Disable primary selection (middle-click copy/paste)."
msgstr "禁用主选区（中键复制/粘贴）。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Focus main surface instead of popup menus"
msgstr "聚焦主表面而非弹出菜单"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Focus the main surface instead of popup menus. Works around some bugs in Qt-"
"based apps related to copy-paste."
msgstr "聚焦主表面而非弹出菜单。可绕过 Qt 应用中与复制粘贴相关的一些缺陷。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Keep last focused toplevel activated"
msgstr "保持最后聚焦的顶层窗口处于活动状态"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When a layer-shell view grabs keyboard focus, keep the last focused toplevel "
"view as activated."
msgstr "当 layer-shell 窗口获取键盘焦点时，保持最后聚焦的顶层窗口处于活动状态。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Auto-reload Config"
msgstr "自动重载配置"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Automatically reload the config file when it's modified."
msgstr "配置文件被修改时自动重载。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Config reload delay"
msgstr "配置重载延迟"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Delay in milliseconds after a config file change before reloading."
msgstr "配置文件更改后延迟重载的时间（毫秒）。"
